speechtext:
Securing of tenders for sub-trades and awarding of subcontracts including the amount of each subcontract is the responsibility of the general contractor. Consequently, this question cannot be answered in total. However, the general contractor nominated the following 10 main subcontractors in his tender form: Precast, prestressed and architectural precast concrete, Schokbeton; Aluminum windows, Robert Mitchell; Security hardware and metal work, Chubb, Mosler and Taylor; Kitchen equipment, Rideau Aluminum; Laundry equipment, Canadian Laundry Limited; Roofing, Tasco Roofing and Sheet Metal; Structural steel, Canada Iron; Water storage tanks, Steen Mechanical Contractors;
Questions
Plumbing, heating and ventilation, Steen Mechanical Contractors; Electrical work, Canadian Comstock.
